--- WHY THIS RUN IS SUPERSEDED ---
This regression did NOT contain CFDAppBenchmarkSuiteSmoke. The test was
registered in tests/CMakeLists.txt behind `if(TARGET cfd_benchmark_cpu)`, but
the root CMakeLists adds tests/ (line ~114) BEFORE benchmarks/ (line ~137), so
the target did not yet exist and the guard silently dropped the entry.

The giveaway is in the numbers above: 2048 / 2042 / 1982 are IDENTICAL to
P13-006's regression, when one more test should have appeared.

The registration moved to benchmarks/CMakeLists.txt and the regression was
re-run in full. This log is kept because a green run that did not cover what it
claimed is worth keeping visible, not deleting.
